                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Having looked at your comment, and it being the top search result, hopefully this will help other people who want to keep their theme values:\r\n\r\nIMHO a different solution that works with your theme and falls back automatically would be to use vim.g.terminal_color* vals.\r\n\r\nSo, inside your mini-indentscope.lua:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal symbol_color = vim.g.terminal_color_2 or '#FFFFFF'\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('ColorScheme', {\r\n    pattern = \"*\",\r\n    callback = function()\r\n        vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniIndentscopeSymbol', { fg = symbol_color, nocombine = true })\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nTheme colors are:\r\n```lua\r\ng.terminal_color_0 = colors.black\r\ng.terminal_color_1 = colors.red\r\ng.terminal_color_2 = colors.green\r\ng.terminal_color_3 = colors.yellow\r\ng.terminal_color_4 = colors.purple\r\ng.terminal_color_5 = colors.pink\r\ng.terminal_color_6 = colors.cyan\r\ng.terminal_color_7 = colors.white\r\ng.terminal_color_8 = colors.selection\r\ng.terminal_color_9 = colors.bright_red\r\ng.terminal_color_10 = colors.bright_green\r\ng.terminal_color_11 = colors.bright_yellow\r\ng.terminal_color_12 = colors.bright_blue\r\ng.terminal_color_13 = colors.bright_magenta\r\ng.terminal_color_14 = colors.bright_cyan\r\ng.terminal_color_15 = colors.bright_white\r\ng.terminal_color_background = colors.bg\r\ng.terminal_color_foreground = colors.fg\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere is an example of how to integrate it into the config:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nreturn {\r\n  {\r\n    'echasnovski/mini.indentscope',\r\n    version = false,\r\n    opts = {\r\n      draw = {\r\n        delay = 100,\r\n        animation = \r\n      },\r\n     symbol = '▏',\r\n     options = { try_as_border = true },\r\n    },\r\n    init = function()\r\n      vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('ColorScheme', {\r\n        pattern = '*',\r\n        callback = function()\r\n          -- terminal_color_2 (green) or fallback to white\r\n          local symbol_color = vim.g.terminal_color_2 or '#FFFFFF'\r\n          vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniIndentscopeSymbol', {\r\n            fg = symbol_color,\r\n            nocombine = true,\r\n          })\r\n        end,\r\n      })\r\n    end,\r\n  },\r\n}\r\n```",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Having looked at your comment, and it being the top search result, hopefully this will help other people who want to keep their theme values:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">IMHO a different solution that works with your theme and falls back automatically would be to use vim.g.terminal_color* vals.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So, inside your mini-indentscope.lua:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"local symbol_color = vim.g.terminal_color_2 or '#FFFFFF'\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('ColorScheme', {\n    pattern = &quot;*&quot;,\n    callback = function()\n        vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniIndentscopeSymbol', { fg = symbol_color, nocombine = true })\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">symbol_color</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_2</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>#FFFFFF<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>ColorScheme<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_set_hl</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>MiniIndentscopeSymbol<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">fg</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">symbol_color</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">nocombine</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span> })\n})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Theme colors are:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"g.terminal_color_0 = colors.black\ng.terminal_color_1 = colors.red\ng.terminal_color_2 = colors.green\ng.terminal_color_3 = colors.yellow\ng.terminal_color_4 = colors.purple\ng.terminal_color_5 = colors.pink\ng.terminal_color_6 = colors.cyan\ng.terminal_color_7 = colors.white\ng.terminal_color_8 = colors.selection\ng.terminal_color_9 = colors.bright_red\ng.terminal_color_10 = colors.bright_green\ng.terminal_color_11 = colors.bright_yellow\ng.terminal_color_12 = colors.bright_blue\ng.terminal_color_13 = colors.bright_magenta\ng.terminal_color_14 = colors.bright_cyan\ng.terminal_color_15 = colors.bright_white\ng.terminal_color_background = colors.bg\ng.terminal_color_foreground = colors.fg\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_0</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">black</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_1</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">red</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_2</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">green</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_3</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">yellow</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_4</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">purple</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_5</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">pink</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_6</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">cyan</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_7</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">white</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_8</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">selection</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_9</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_red</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_10</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_green</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_11</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_yellow</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_12</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_blue</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_13</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_magenta</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_14</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_cyan</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_15</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bright_white</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_background</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bg</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_foreground</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">colors</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fg</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Here is an example of how to integrate it into the config:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"return {\n  {\n    'echasnovski/mini.indentscope',\n    version = false,\n    opts = {\n      draw = {\n        delay = 100,\n        animation = \n      },\n     symbol = '▏',\n     options = { try_as_border = true },\n    },\n    init = function()\n      vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('ColorScheme', {\n        pattern = '*',\n        callback = function()\n          -- terminal_color_2 (green) or fallback to white\n          local symbol_color = vim.g.terminal_color_2 or '#FFFFFF'\n          vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniIndentscopeSymbol', {\n            fg = symbol_color,\n            nocombine = true,\n          })\n        end,\n      })\n    end,\n  },\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> {\n  {\n    <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>echasnovski/mini.indentscope<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">version</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">draw</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">delay</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">100</span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">animation</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> \n      },\n     <span class=\"pl-smi\">symbol</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>▏<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n     <span class=\"pl-smi\">options</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">try_as_border</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span> },\n    },\n    <span class=\"pl-en\">init</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>ColorScheme<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>*<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n          <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> terminal_color_2 (green) or fallback to white</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">symbol_color</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">g</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">terminal_color_2</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>#FFFFFF<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n          <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_set_hl</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>MiniIndentscopeSymbol<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">fg</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">symbol_color</span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">nocombine</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,\n          })\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n      })\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n  },\n}</pre></div>",
                    "bodyText": "Having looked at your comment, and it being the top search result, hopefully this will help other people who want to keep their theme values:\nIMHO a different solution that works with your theme and falls back automatically would be to use vim.g.terminal_color* vals.\nSo, inside your mini-indentscope.lua:\nlocal symbol_color = vim.g.terminal_color_2 or '#FFFFFF'\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('ColorScheme', {\n    pattern = \"*\",\n    callback = function()\n        vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniIndentscopeSymbol', { fg = symbol_color, nocombine = true })\n})\nTheme colors are:\ng.terminal_color_0 = colors.black\ng.terminal_color_1 = colors.red\ng.terminal_color_2 = colors.green\ng.terminal_color_3 = colors.yellow\ng.terminal_color_4 = colors.purple\ng.terminal_color_5 = colors.pink\ng.terminal_color_6 = colors.cyan\ng.terminal_color_7 = colors.white\ng.terminal_color_8 = colors.selection\ng.terminal_color_9 = colors.bright_red\ng.terminal_color_10 = colors.bright_green\ng.terminal_color_11 = colors.bright_yellow\ng.terminal_color_12 = colors.bright_blue\ng.terminal_color_13 = colors.bright_magenta\ng.terminal_color_14 = colors.bright_cyan\ng.terminal_color_15 = colors.bright_white\ng.terminal_color_background = colors.bg\ng.terminal_color_foreground = colors.fg\nHere is an example of how to integrate it into the config:\nreturn {\n  {\n    'echasnovski/mini.indentscope',\n    version = false,\n    opts = {\n      draw = {\n        delay = 100,\n        animation = \n      },\n     symbol = '▏',\n     options = { try_as_border = true },\n    },\n    init = function()\n      vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('ColorScheme', {\n        pattern = '*',\n        callback = function()\n          -- terminal_color_2 (green) or fallback to white\n          local symbol_color = vim.g.terminal_color_2 or '#FFFFFF'\n          vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniIndentscopeSymbol', {\n            fg = symbol_color,\n            nocombine = true,\n          })\n        end,\n      })\n    end,\n  },\n}",
